{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00739","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享懿德太子庙乐章 登歌酌鬯 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享懿德太子庙乐章 登歌酌鬯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"誉阐元储，寄崇明两。\n玉裕虽晦，铜楼可想。\n弦诵辍音，笙歌罢响。\n币帛言设，礼容无爽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}